<!-- 加载占位：沿用真实区块的类名和尺寸（头像、姓名、职位、评分、简介、客户评价），标题显示真实文字。
     简介和评价按最常见的情况各画一行（多数简介只有一行，很多理发师暂无评价），避免数据返回后卡片明显缩短。
     「立即预约」需要理发师数据，加载完成后才出现。 -->
<view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="staff-page" role="status" aria-label="正在加载理发师信息">
  <view class="profile">
    <view class="avatar skeleton-block staff-skeleton-avatar"></view>
    <view class="skeleton-line staff-skeleton-name"></view>
    <view class="skeleton-line staff-skeleton-role"></view>
    <view class="skeleton-line staff-skeleton-rating"></view>
    <view class="favorite"><view class="skeleton-block staff-skeleton-heart"></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="page">
    <view class="card section">
      <view class="skeleton-line staff-skeleton-text staff-skeleton-text--last"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="card section">
      <view class="section-title">客户评价</view>
      <view class="skeleton-line staff-skeleton-reviewer"></view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<view wx:else class="staff-page">
  <view class="profile">
    <image class="avatar" mode="aspectFill" src="{{staff.imageUrl}}" bindtap="previewAvatar" aria-role="button" aria-label="查看理发师头像大图" />
    <view class="name">{{staff.name}}</view>
    <view class="role">{{staff.roleText}}</view>
    <view class="rating">
      <text>{{staff.ratingText}}</text>
      <view>
        <view wx:if="{{staff.hasRating}}" class="stars"><image wx:for="{{staff.starIcons}}" wx:key="*this" class="rating-star" mode="aspectFit" src="{{item}}" /></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="favorite" bindtap="toggleFavorite" aria-role="button" aria-label="{{isFavorite ? '取消收藏' : '收藏理发师'}}{{favoriteCount > 0 ? '，已被收藏' + favoriteCount + '次' : ''}}">
      <image mode="aspectFit" src="{{isFavorite ? '/assets/icons/favorite_pink.png' : '/assets/icons/favorite_border.png'}}" aria-hidden="true" />
      <text class="favorite-count">{{favoriteCount > 0 ? favoriteCount : ''}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="page">
    <view class="card section">
      <view class="desc">{{staff.bioText}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="card section">
      <view class="section-title">客户评价<text wx:if="{{staff.reviewCount > 0}}">（{{staff.reviewCount}}）</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!reviews.length && !loadingReviews && !reviewsError}}" class="muted">暂无评价</view>
      <view wx:for="{{reviews}}" wx:for-index="reviewIndex" wx:key="id" class="review">
        <view class="review-head">
          <text>{{item.userText}}</text>
        </view>
        <review-booking-info service-name="{{item.serviceName || item.service}}" staff-name="{{item.staffName || staff.name}}" />
        <review-rating-summary rating="{{item.rating}}" ratings="{{item.ratings}}" />
        <view class="desc">{{item.comment}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.imageUrls.length}}" class="review-images">
          <image wx:for="{{item.imageUrls}}" wx:for-item="image" wx:key="*this" class="review-image" mode="aspectFill" src="{{image}}" lazy-load webp="{{true}}" binderror="onImageError" data-path="reviews[{{reviewIndex}}].imageUrls[{{index}}]" data-src="{{image}}" bindtap="previewReviewImage" data-url="{{image}}" data-review-index="{{reviewIndex}}" />
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{reviews.length || loadingReviews || reviewsError}}" class="pagination-state">
        <text wx:if="{{loadingReviews}}">正在加载...</text>
        <view wx:elif="{{reviewsError}}">
          <view>{{reviewsError}}</view>
          <button class="retry" bindtap="retryReviews">重试加载</button>
        </view>
        <text wx:elif="{{hasMoreReviews}}">上拉加载更多</text>
        <text wx:else>没有更多评价了</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="bar">
    <button class="primary-btn" bindtap="book">立即预约</button>
  </view>
</view>
